{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Lightyears of Fervent Warfare?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil Neh empire has the Planets of the Kex star system in its iron grasp. You steal a ship and your perilous journey on the sky road to freedom unfolds! Complete bounties on the way an use the rewards to unlock and upgrade your ship's arsenal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916360/extras/6760a40ef7828db590988f8bc4e31219.poster.avif?t=1774531646\" width=404 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916360/extras/6760a40ef7828db590988f8bc4e31219.webm?t=1774531646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916360/extras/6760a40ef7828db590988f8bc4e31219.mp4?t=1774531646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LoFW's Feature Set</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some features, with more to come (I'm open to suggestions!):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable and upgradeable ship tech that packs a punch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-player local co-op!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet ricochets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grungy player ship armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy ship armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Programmatically generated explosions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounty missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a tutorial with friendly alien Wex!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_i